iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_962161730037288_3914696945326120159_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GMMwCfmNRvQQ7kNvwFIe8fQ&_nc_oc=AdoZohuqy_ienEc5OIr24Qp7DQ39dNh-K5SJgeOCOSitbNG7HVkn48TqKFqw8yCsAwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0_2YUSqqbCqb0REA9xKCfWkU1RBGEu7N50IFAaCAg73A&oe=69E3739E"}, {"file_name": "app-icon-light_512.png", "id": "901120359395239", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_901120362728572_2520065415214302489_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uy0f-m6zZIEQ7kNvwGmBB_l&_nc_oc=AdqhSuaZZNreaNtyOZ83MvVQFLXjzCdN6qJCGckntHrLfZxbuB20RvQ8ibv4rGtqoh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af16IQ4awb1_FuN8LV9DyDLlYGQ-qUQc_RsTlMqSHbdxVw&oe=69E369F3"}]}, "id": "5282278771997850", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office : La solution bureautique VR gratuite\n\nD\u00e9couvrez Polaris Office sur Meta Horizon OS. Visualisez et modifiez gratuitement vos fichiers PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet et TXT instantan\u00e9ment\u2014sans aucune connexion requise.\n\nProfitez d'une \u00e9dition fluide et sans publicit\u00e9 sur un \u00e9cran virtuel g\u00e9ant. Optimis\u00e9 pour les manettes Meta Quest et divers p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques, Polaris Office offre une productivit\u00e9 de bureau en environnement spatial. Ma\u00eetrisez votre flux de travail en VR.", "short_description": "Polaris Office : La solution bureautique VR gratuite\n\nD\u00e9couvrez Polaris Office sur Meta Horizon OS. Visualisez et modifiez gratuitement vos fichiers PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet et TXT instantan\u00e9ment\u2014sans aucune connexion requise.\n\nProfitez d'une \u00e9dition fluide et sans publicit\u00e9 sur un \u00e9cran virtuel g\u00e9ant. Optimis\u00e9 pour les manettes Meta Quest et divers p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques, Polaris Office offre une productivit\u00e9 de bureau en environnement spatial. Ma\u00eetrisez votre flux de travail en VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2496515564137561", "locale": "ru_RU", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\n\u041f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 Polaris Office \u043d\u0430 Meta Horizon OS. \u041f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet \u0438 TXT \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0438 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0435\u0433\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438.\n\n\u0420\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u043c\u044b \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432\u0438\u0440\u0442\u0443\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u044d\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435. \u041f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u043f\u0442\u0438\u043c\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0434 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0440\u044b Meta Quest \u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043c\u043e \u0441 \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0448\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0432\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0430. Polaris Office \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u044f \u041f\u041a \u0432 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435. \u0412\u0430\u0448 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u044b\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u0441\u0441 \u0432 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043c \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0435 VR.", "short_description": "\n\u041f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 Polaris Office \u043d\u0430 Meta Horizon OS. \u041f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet \u0438 TXT \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0438 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0435\u0433\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438.\n\n\u0420\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u043c\u044b \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432\u0438\u0440\u0442\u0443\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u044d\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435. \u041f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u043f\u0442\u0438\u043c\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0434 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0440\u044b Meta Quest \u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043c\u043e \u0441 \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0448\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0432\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0430. Polaris Office \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u044f \u041f\u041a \u0432 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435. \u0412\u0430\u0448 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u044b\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u0441\u0441 \u0432 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043c \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0435 VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1937859293790216", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office: La soluzione ufficio VR gratuita definitiva\n\nScopri Polaris Office su Meta Horizon OS. Visualizza e modifica PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet e TXT gratis e senza login.\n\nGoditi un'esperienza di editing fluida e senza pubblicit\u00e0 su un enorme schermo virtuale. Ottimizzato per i controller Meta Quest e compatibile con vari dispositivi di input, Polaris Office offre produttivit\u00e0 di livello desktop in un ambiente spaziale. Ottimizza il tuo workflow, ora reinventato per la VR.", "short_description": "Polaris Office: La soluzione ufficio VR gratuita definitiva\n\nScopri Polaris Office su Meta Horizon OS. Visualizza e modifica PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet e TXT gratis e senza login.\n\nGoditi un'esperienza di editing fluida e senza pubblicit\u00e0 su un enorme schermo virtuale. Ottimizzato per i controller Meta Quest e compatibile con vari dispositivi di input, Polaris Office offre produttivit\u00e0 di livello desktop in un ambiente spaziale. Ottimizza il tuo workflow, ora reinventato per la VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1852688745431678", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office: La soluci\u00f3n ofim\u00e1tica gratuita definitiva para VR\n\nDescubre Polaris Office en Meta Horizon OS. Visualiza y edita PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet y TXT gratis y sin iniciar sesi\u00f3n.\n\nDisfruta de una edici\u00f3n fluida y sin publicidad en una pantalla virtual gigante. Optimizado para controles Meta Quest y compatible con diversos dispositivos de entrada, ofrece productividad de escritorio en un entorno espacial. Domina tu flujo de trabajo, ahora reinventado para VR.", "short_description": "Polaris Office: La soluci\u00f3n ofim\u00e1tica gratuita definitiva para VR\n\nDescubre Polaris Office en Meta Horizon OS. Visualiza y edita PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet y TXT gratis y sin iniciar sesi\u00f3n.\n\nDisfruta de una edici\u00f3n fluida y sin publicidad en una pantalla virtual gigante. Optimizado para controles Meta Quest y compatible con diversos dispositivos de entrada, ofrece productividad de escritorio en un entorno espacial. Domina tu flujo de trabajo, ahora reinventado para VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1454186129595600", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office: A solu\u00e7\u00e3o de escrit\u00f3rio VR gratuita definitiva\n\nDescubra o Polaris Office no Meta Horizon OS. Visualize e edite ficheiros PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet e TXT gr\u00e1tis e sem login.\n\nDesfrute de uma edi\u00e7\u00e3o fluida e sem an\u00fancios num ecr\u00e3 virtual gigante. Otimizado para os comandos Meta Quest e compat\u00edvel com diversos dispositivos, o Polaris Office oferece produtividade de PC num ambiente espacial. Domine o seu fluxo de trabalho, agora reinventado para VR.", "short_description": "Polaris Office: A solu\u00e7\u00e3o de escrit\u00f3rio VR gratuita definitiva\n\nDescubra o Polaris Office no Meta Horizon OS. Visualize e edite ficheiros PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet e TXT gr\u00e1tis e sem login.\n\nDesfrute de uma edi\u00e7\u00e3o fluida e sem an\u00fancios num ecr\u00e3 virtual gigante. Otimizado para os comandos Meta Quest e compat\u00edvel com diversos dispositivos, o Polaris Office oferece produtividade de PC num ambiente espacial. Domine o seu fluxo de trabalho, agora reinventado para VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1304396544867044", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office: Nihai \u00dccretsiz VR Ofis \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm\u00fc\n\nMeta Horizon OS \u00fczerinde Polaris Office'i ke\u015ffedin. PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet ve TXT formatlar\u0131n\u0131 oturum a\u00e7madan, an\u0131nda ve tamamen \u00fccretsiz d\u00fczenleyin.\n\nDevasa sanal ekranda reklams\u0131z ve ak\u0131c\u0131 d\u00fczenleme deneyiminin keyfini \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n. Meta Quest kontrol cihazlar\u0131 ve harici giri\u015f ayg\u0131tlar\u0131yla tam uyumlu Polaris Office, mekansal bili\u015fimde masa\u00fcst\u00fc verimlili\u011fi sunar. VR i\u00e7in yeniden tasarlanan ofis deneyimine hemen ba\u015flay\u0131n.", "short_description": "Polaris Office: Nihai \u00dccretsiz VR Ofis \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm\u00fc\n\nMeta Horizon OS \u00fczerinde Polaris Office'i ke\u015ffedin. PDF, Word, Slide, Sheet ve TXT formatlar\u0131n\u0131 oturum a\u00e7madan, an\u0131nda ve tamamen \u00fccretsiz d\u00fczenleyin.\n\nDevasa sanal ekranda reklams\u0131z ve ak\u0131c\u0131 d\u00fczenleme deneyiminin keyfini \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n. Meta Quest kontrol cihazlar\u0131 ve harici giri\u015f ayg\u0131tlar\u0131yla tam uyumlu Polaris Office, mekansal bili\u015fimde masa\u00fcst\u00fc verimlili\u011fi sunar. VR i\u00e7in yeniden tasarlanan ofis deneyimine hemen ba\u015flay\u0131n."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1291991179696709", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Polaris Office", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Polaris Office\uff1aVR\u3067\u51fa\u4f1a\u3046\u7a76\u6975\u306e\u7121\u6599\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u30bd\u30ea\u30e5\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\n\n\u3064\u3044\u306bMeta Horizon OS\u3067\u3082Polaris Office\u304c\u767b\u5834\u3002PDF\u3001Word\u3001Slide\u3001Sheet\u3001TXT\u306a\u3069\u3001\u591a\u5f69\u306a\u6587\u66f8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u3092\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u306a\u3057\u3067\u3059\u3050\u306b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3067\u304d\u3001\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u7121\u6599\u3067\u7de8\u96c6\u304c\u53ef\u80fd\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\u5de8\u5927\u306a\u4eee\u60f3\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u3067